  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Minds, Transforming Lives: Mastering the Ethics of AI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A massive open online course (MOOC) will be developed to offer a comprehensive understanding on the ethical dimensions and policy areas of AI development and deployment based on the UNESCO Recommendation. Its overarching purpose is to empower experts to become champions and advocates on the ethical practices of AI &#x2014; those that harness AI&apos;s potential while adhering unwaveringly to ethical principles like fairness, transparency, and human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
